<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Fernandez to Japan on commercial visit.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Fernandez to Japan on commercial visit.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Economy Minister Roque Fernandez will fly to Japan Friday night for a visit to promote comercial relations between the two countries, state news agency Telam said Thursday.</p>
<p>Fernandez will travel accompanied by 50 businessmen and will advertise Argentina's investment opportunities and make several presentations to Japanese businessmen on the country's economic performance, Telam said.</p>
<p>Fernandez is expected to return to Argentina next Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Daniel Helft, Buenos Aires Newsroom + 541 318 0663))</p>
